{"step_index":283,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-09T03:57:09Z","thinking":"**Verifying Today's Corporate Numbers**\n\nNeed to confirm the presence or absence of corporate registration numbers for today's 200 companies. The verification will focus on whether any entries possess a corporate registration number. Referencing previous work, the assumption is that the 200 companies should have business registration numbers.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst inputFile = 'C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e1493fa0-e8a4-4717-a46c-5bc1b3357473/scratch/input_batch.tsv';\nconst cache = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/e1493fa0-e8a4-4717-a46c-5bc1b3357473/scratch/bizno_200_cache.json', 'utf-8'));\nconst lines = fs.readFileSync(inputFile, 'utf-8').split(/\\r?\\n/).filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\n\nlet corpFound = [];\nlines.forEach((l, idx) => {\n  const p = l.split('\\t');\n  const company = p[2] ? p[2].trim() : '';\n  const bizno = p[3] ? p[3].trim() : '';\n  const mid = bizno.substring(3, 5);\n  \n  // check if any cell in raw row has a 13-digit number or 6-7 digit corp number\n  for (let col = 0; col < p.length; col++) {\n    const val = p[col].trim();\n    if (/^\\d{6}-?\\d{7}$/.test(val) && val !== bizno) {\n      corpFound.push({ idx: idx + 1, company, bizno, field: 'raw', val });\n    }\n  }\n\n  // check if cache has corp number\n  const c = cache[bizno] || {};\n  if (c.corpNo) {\n    corpFound.push({ idx: idx + 1, company, bizno, field: 'cache', val: c.corpNo });\n  }\n\n  // check if mid is not personal\n  const midNum = Number(mid);\n  if (!((midNum >= 1 && midNum <= 79) || (midNum >= 90 && midNum <= 99))) {\n    corpFound.push({ idx: idx + 1, company, bizno, field: 'mid', mid });\n  }\n});\n\nconsole.log('Total corp numbers or corp entities found:', corpFound.length);\nif (corpFound.length > 0) {\n  console.log(corpFound);\n} else {\n  console.log('200개 전체 기업 모두 개인사업자이며 법인번호는 1건도 없습니다.');\n}\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\import_company_database_list","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Verifying corporate numbers in batch","toolSummary":"Verify corp numbers"}}]}
